Z||000000||Formula88||08-22-2001||11:14 AM||||Anyone checked this out?  Might be a source for larger throttle bodies for our V6's as well.  <BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fdpperformance/tb.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fdpperformance/tb.html</A> <P>I just heard about them on the GrandAmGT forum.  <A HREF="http://www.grandamgt.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.grandamgt.com</A> ||||reg||5
