Z||000006||Oreif||08-22-2001||02:11 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GSXPete:<BR><B>so no one sells aftermarket throttlebodies?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The Fiero Store sells a 3mm bored TB for $199, But the throttle plate quality is poor (lots of spaces/gaps causing high idle) and you still need the plenum bored. Go with Darrel, Best deal for the money!||||reg||1
Z||000007||MinnGreenGT||08-22-2001||03:10 PM||||You can either email Darrel (morse86@aol.com) or call him directly (preferred)763-441-5679.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">     <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
