Z||000020||LarryB||08-24-2001||03:22 PM||||From my limited experience with him I think Darrell checks his email queue only once per day, so all you might need is to be a bit patient.||||reg||1
Z||000021||Fierokid87||08-26-2001||12:34 AM||||I talked to Darrel.  He is a very nice guy even to just BS about Fieros.  He seems love these cars, and is very willing to help out those in need.  I am deffinatly going to send him my plenum and TB for boreing.  And then I think Ill keep doing buisness with him with the strut tower brace, his cradle bushings, poly engine mount, and Dog bone.<P>Scott<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLOODY"> Fierokid's  Web site<BR>http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero<P>AIM: Fieroguy1987<BR>ICQ: Fierokid</FONT><P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
